Z||000000||Haze_Performance||10-01-2000||04:31 AM||||I was surfing on eBay and I came across this. <A HREF="http://cgi.ebay.com/ebaymotors/aw-cgi/ebayISAPI.dll?ViewItem&item=451802114&r=0&t=0" TARGET=_blank>http://cgi.ebay.com/ebaymotors/aw-cgi/ebayISAPI.dll?ViewItem&item=451802114&r=0&t=0</A> <BR>For the hell of it I ran it through Carfax.<P>This is what I got: <P>Vehicle ID:       1G2PG3797FP242093        <BR>Yr/Mfg:       1985 Pontiac  <BR>Model:       Fiero GT  <BR>Body:       2D Cpe. 2-seat car  <BR>Engine:       2.8L V6 FI  <BR>Fuel:       Gasoline  <BR>Driveline:       Rear-wheel drive  <BR>Aspiration:       Normal  <BR>Country Mfg.:       United States  <P><BR>Salvage/Junk Title    PROBLEM TITLE FOUND  <P>-------------------------------------------<BR>07/12/1996   40,233  SALVAGE TITLE/CERTIFICATE <P>-------------------------------------------<P>It must have been totaled but the guys says its clean & was garage kept.<P>I guess ya cant just take peoples work anymore.   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif"><P>DATE       ODOMETER       INFORMATION       GENERAL  <BR>REPORTED       READING       SOURCE       COMMENTS  <BR>                               <BR>06/06/1985       7       Kansas       Title issued  <BR>                    Motor Vehicle Dept.            <BR>                    Kansas City, KS            <BR>                               <BR>05/06/1994       26,412       Kansas       Title issued  <BR>                    Motor Vehicle Dept.            <BR>                    Shawnee Mission, KS            <BR>                    Title #D2724989            <BR>                               <BR>08/31/1995       33,334       Kansas       Title issued  <BR>                    Motor Vehicle Dept.            <BR>                    Olathe, KS            <BR>                    Title #E0371666            <BR>                               <BR>01/03/1996             Kansas       Title issued  <BR>                    Motor Vehicle Dept.       First lien reported  <BR>                    Olathe, KS            <BR>                    Title #F0148262            <BR>                               <BR>07/12/1996       40,233       Kansas       SALVAGE TITLE/CERTIFICATE  <BR>                    Motor Vehicle Dept.       ISSUED  <BR>                    Kansas City, KS            <BR>                    Title #G0003976            <BR>                               <BR>05/23/1997             Missouri       SALVAGE TITLE/CERTIFICATE  <BR>                    Motor Vehicle Dept.       ISSUED  <BR>                    Neosho, MO       Exempt from odometer  <BR>                    Title #TE517773       reporting  <P><BR>------------------<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/2d_00010aa3.gif">   <P><B>Website's<BR>  <A HREF="http://www.WS6Fiero.com" TARGET=_blank>www.WS6Fiero.com</A><P>                  <A HREF="http://www.hazeperformance.com" TARGET=_blank>www.HazePerformance.com </A></B><p>[This message has been edited by Haze_Performance (edited 10-01-2000).]||||reg||8
Z||000001||Haze_Performance||10-01-2000||04:42 AM||||Ok Ok...Last one<BR> <A HREF="http://cgi.ebay.com/ebaymotors/aw-cgi/ebayISAPI.dll?ViewItem&item=452740624&r=0&t=0" TARGET=_blank>http://cgi.ebay.com/ebaymotors/aw-cgi/ebayISAPI.dll?ViewItem&item=452740624&r=0&t=0</A> <P>15in factory wheels Lotus suspension and low profile, this car can really handle the road. 1988 was the last year for the Fiero’s and Pontiac finally got it right.<P>-------------------------------------------<P>Vehicle ID:       1G2PE1195JP225790        <BR>Yr/Mfg:       1988 Pontiac  <BR>Model:       Fiero  <BR>Body:       2D Cpe. 2-seat car  <BR>Engine:       2.8L V6 FI  <BR>Fuel:       Gasoline  <BR>Driveline:       Rear-wheel drive  <BR>Aspiration:       Normal  <BR>Country Mfg.:       United States  <BR> ----------------------------------------<P><BR>DATE       ODOMETER       INFORMATION       GENERAL  <BR>REPORTED       READING       SOURCE       COMMENTS  <BR>                               <BR>10/31/1988       14       Florida       Title issued  <BR>                    Motor Vehicle Dept.       First lien reported  <BR>                    Jupiter, FL            <BR>                    Title #46683467            <BR>                               <BR>12/17/1988             Florida       Accident Reported  <BR>                    Police Report       Involving a front impact  <BR>                    Merritt Island, FL       with a pedestrian  <BR>                    Case #083266973            <BR>                               <BR>07/04/1989             Florida       Accident Reported  <BR>                    Police Report       Involving right side impact  <BR>                    Melbourne, FL       with another motor vehicle  <BR>                    Case #083050799            <BR>                               <BR>06/05/1990       13,400       Florida       Title issued  <BR>                    Motor Vehicle Dept.       Odometer reading recorded  <BR>                    Melbourne, FL       on 05/17/1990  <BR>                    Title #46683467            <BR>                               <BR>05/24/1994       56,079       Florida       Title issued  <BR>                    Motor Vehicle Dept.       First lien reported  <BR>                    Orange City, FL       Odometer reading recorded  <BR>                    Title #46683467       on 05/04/1994  <BR>                               <BR>09/13/1994       63,173       Florida       Title issued  <BR>                    Motor Vehicle Dept.       Odometer reading recorded  <BR>                    De Land, FL       on 08/16/1994  <BR>                    Title #46683467            <BR>                               <BR>09/30/1994       63,182       Florida       Title issued  <BR>                    Motor Vehicle Dept.       First lien reported  <BR>                    Orange City, FL       Odometer reading recorded  <BR>                    Title #46683467       on 09/12/1994  <BR>                               <BR>04/18/1995       69,372       New Jersey       Title issued  <BR>                    Motor Vehicle Dept.            <BR>                    Harrison, NJ            <BR>                    Title            <BR>                    #1G2PE1195JP225790            <BR>                               <BR>09/25/1995       74,713       Florida       Title issued  <BR>                    Motor Vehicle Dept.       Odometer reading recorded  <BR>                    Orange City, FL       on 09/05/1995  <BR>                    Title #69775640            <BR>                               <BR>02/28/1996       81,452       Auto Auction       Vehicle Sold  <BR>                    Southeast Region            <BR><P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/2d_00010aa3.gif">  <P><B>Website's<BR>  <A HREF="http://www.WS6Fiero.com" TARGET=_blank>www.WS6Fiero.com</A><P>                  <A HREF="http://www.hazeperformance.com" TARGET=_blank>www.HazePerformance.com </A></B>||||reg||7
